                // ä¸è¦ç«‹å³è®¡ç®—ç»“æœï¼Œå› ä¸ºæ ¹å·åé¢å¯èƒ½è¿˜æœ‰æ•°å­—
                // ç­‰å¾…ç”¨æˆ·è¾“å…¥æ•°å­—åå†è®¡ç®—
                break;
            case Symbol.SIN:
            case Symbol.COS:
            case Symbol.TAN:
                // Handle trigonometric functions as special operators
                this.inputOperators(len, value);
                break;
            default:
                this.inputOperators(len, value);
                break;
        }
        this.formatInputValue();
    }
    /**
     * Enter numbers.
     *
     * @param value Enter numbers.
     */
    inputNumber(value) {
        if (CheckEmptyUtil.isEmpty(value)) {
            return;
        }
        let len = this.expressions.length;
        let last = len > 0 ? this.expressions[len - 1] : '';
        let secondLast = len > 1 ? this.expressions[len - CommonConstants.TWO] : undefined;
        if (!this.validateEnter(last, value)) {
            return;
        }
        if (!last) {
            this.expressions.push(value);
        }
        else if (last === CommonConstants.SQRT || last === CommonConstants.SIN ||
            last === CommonConstants.COS || last === CommonConstants.TAN) {
            // å¦‚æœä¸Šä¸€ä¸ªæ˜¯æ ¹å·æˆ–ä¸‰è§’å‡½æ•°ï¼Œæ¨å…¥æ–°æ•°å­—
            this.expressions.push(value);
